# Project-specific
#
# results/ IS tracked. The tables under results/ are the output of
# simulations/run_all.py and are checked in deliberately, so that a reader can
# see what the studies produce without running them. Regenerate with:
#     python3 simulations/run_all.py
# Scratch output from ad-hoc runs goes here instead and is not tracked.
scratch/
*.log
